{{!
    @template local_oksigeniafamily/claim_done

    After a family claims a code: who they are family of now (brothers and sisters too), and what each plugin gives them:
    first what is the adult's own (the app), then what is for each child, under their name when there are several.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * done - Who they are family of now.
    * linksheading - The heading of the links.
    * groups - A list of { name, links }: name is empty for the adult's own and when there is one child; links is a list
      of { label, url, pin, note } from the plugins.
    * pinlabel - How the PIN is introduced.
    * haslinks - Whether there are any.
    * nolinks - What to say when there are none.
    * mailnote - When the visitor typed an address: that a link went to it if it is an account's ('' for nothing). It
      says the same whether it is or not.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "done": "You are now family of Ana and Leo at Colegio Ejemplo.",
        "linksheading": "What you have now:",
        "groups": [
            {
                "name": "",
                "links": [{ "label": "Open the app", "url": "https://example.com/local/oksigeniaaty/family.php", "pin": "" }]
            },
            {
                "name": "Ana",
                "links": [{ "label": "Canteen", "url": "https://example.com/local/oksigeniameals/k.php", "pin": "4826" }]
            },
            {
                "name": "Leo",
                "links": [{ "label": "Canteen", "url": "https://example.com/local/oksigeniameals/k.php", "pin": "1937" }]
            }
        ],
        "pinlabel": "PIN",
        "haslinks": true,
        "nolinks": "The school will tell you how to go on.",
        "mailnote": "If that address has an account at Colegio Ejemplo, we have sent it a link to see Ana and Leo there too."
    }
}}
<div class="local-oksigeniafamily-claimdone">
    <p class="lead">{{done}}</p>
    {{#haslinks}}
    <h3 class="h5">{{linksheading}}</h3>
    {{#groups}}
    {{#name}}<h4 class="h6 mt-3 mb-2">{{name}}</h4>{{/name}}
    <ul class="list-unstyled">
        {{#links}}
        <li class="mb-3">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>
            {{#pin}}<div class="mt-1">{{pinlabel}}: <strong class="text-monospace">{{pin}}</strong></div>{{/pin}}
            {{#note}}<div class="form-text">{{note}}</div>{{/note}}
        </li>
        {{/links}}
    </ul>
    {{/groups}}
    {{/haslinks}}
    {{^haslinks}}
    <p>{{nolinks}}</p>
    {{/haslinks}}
    {{#mailnote}}<p class="text-muted mt-3">{{mailnote}}</p>{{/mailnote}}
</div>
